{"slug":"frontend-framework-repl-in-siyuan","title":"在思源笔记中嵌入 Vue/Svelte/React 交互式编辑器","date":"2023-04-26","cover":"/logos/siyuan-with-frameworks.png","tags":["Vue","React","Svelte"],"category":"project","excerpt":"在思源笔记中嵌入 Vue/Svelte/React 交互式编辑器","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"背景\">背景</h2>\n<p>个人目前使用的是<a href=\"https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan\">思源笔记</a>记录笔记，且会有大量 web 前端相关的内容，但是存在这几个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>思源笔记对主流前端框架（Vue/React/Svelte）代码高亮支持不是很好</li>\n<li>编写 web 或者 Vue/React/Svelte 相关笔记时，只有代码会稍显枯燥，我希望能辅以展示效果让笔记更直观</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"repl-工具调研\">REPL 工具调研</h2>\n<p>调研了一下三大框架的 REPL 相关库</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/repl\">Vue REPL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://formidable.com/open-source/react-live/\">React Live</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sveltejs/sites/tree/master/packages/repl\">Svelte REPL</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>:::warning TIP\n上述工具中只有 React Live 为非官方，同时 React 也不提供官方 REPL</p>\n<h2 id=\"开发思源笔记挂件\">开发思源笔记挂件</h2>\n<p>思源笔记开放了<a href=\"https://github.com/siyuan-note/bazaar\">官方集市</a>，其中有：模板、图标、主题、挂件、插件（目前尚未完成）</p>\n<p>发现挂件可以很好的满足我的要求，于是分别基于 React/Vue/Svelte 开发了三个挂件，使得在思源笔记中编写各大框架示例成为可能，仓库地址如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Blackman99/siyuan-plugin-vue-repl\">Vue REPL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Blackman99/siyuan-plugin-svelte-repl\">Svelte REPL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Blackman99/siyuan-plugin-react-repl\">React REPL</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"如何使用\">如何使用</h2>\n<p>挂件均已在思源集市中上架</p>\n<p>思源笔记 -> 设置 -> 集市 -> 挂件 -> 找到 Vue/React/Svelte REPL -> 安装即可</p>\n<h2 id=\"效果演示\">效果演示</h2>\n<h3 id=\"demo-vue-repl\">demo-Vue-REPL</h3>\n<figure><img src=\"./posts/demo-vue.gif\" alt=\"Vue REPL\"><figcaption>Vue REPL</figcaption></figure>\n<h3 id=\"demo-svelte-repl\">demo-Svelte-REPL</h3>\n<figure><img src=\"./posts/demo-svelte.gif\" alt=\"Svelte REPL\"><figcaption>Svelte REPL</figcaption></figure>\n<h3 id=\"demo-react-repl\">demo-React-REPL</h3>\n<figure><img src=\"./posts/demo-react.gif\" alt=\"React REPL\"><figcaption>React REPL</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"功能\">功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>大小自动跟随挂件块</li>\n<li>代码自动保存，亦可同步云端</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"使用限制\">使用限制</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一些模块资源使用的是 <a href=\"https://esm.sh\">esm.sh</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://unpkg.com\">unpkg</a> 上的资源，使用时需联网</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"结语\">结语</h2>\n<p>希望能帮助到思源笔记的使用者顺利地用 Vue/Svelte/React 记录笔记！</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考\">参考</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://esm.sh\">esm.sh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://unpkg.com\">unpkg</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan\">思源笔记</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/repl\">Vue REPL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://formidable.com/open-source/react-live/\">React Live</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sveltejs/sites/tree/master/packages/repl\">Svelte REPL</a></li>\n</ul>\n<script>\nimport SpinningLogo from '@vp/demo-components/SpinningLogo.vue'\nexport default {\n  components: {\n    SpinningLogo\n  }\n}\n</script>","related":[{"slug":"publish-casual-ui-2","title":"Casual UI","date":"2022-04-01","cover":"/logos/casual-ui-logo.png","tags":["Vue","React","Svelte"],"category":"project","excerpt":"一个基于Vue3+, React17+, Svelte3+的组件库","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"front-end-framework-compare","title":"Svelte, Vue, React生态小结","date":"2022-08-17","tags":["Vue","React","Svelte"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Svelte, Vue, React生态小结","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"svelte-use-experience","title":"Svelte使用分析","date":"2022-07-01","cover":"/logos/svelte.svg","tags":["Svelte","Vue","React"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Svelte使用分析","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}